window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"You enslaved me!\" \"Nay, I liberated you, my lady. And there will be more liberating to come if you behave.\"</p> <p>Imagine you’re engaged to marry a prince, but your father gambles away your dowry and sells you to a pirate captain who you are forced to marry. He’s cold and ruthless, so you run away, but then you get captured by more pirates, and just as they’re about to hurt you, your pirate husband shows up, with his sword to the captain’s throat as he roars, ”Touch my wife and I will destroy you all.”</p> <p>As seen on TikTok!<i> Married to a Pirate</i> is a steamy dark fantasy romance with adventure and greek mythology.</p> <p>TW: Abuse, sexual violence, death and suicide.</p>"; 
